# The purge. Cesare enters the place Lino read off the frost line, and the
# section blows clear. The payoff of the chapter's one genuinely cooperative
# puzzle, so it gets a scene rather than a line in a box.

uid baggaseqpurge1

say   SEQ_PURGE_1
sound sfx_lever_throw
say   SEQ_PURGE_2
sound hum_high
wait  0.9
sound sfx_capsule_land_far
flag  line_purged
say   SEQ_PURGE_3
